# Model weights and proof fixtures are NEVER committed. They are fetched by
# tools/fetch_models.py from URLs pinned to an immutable upstream commit and
# verified against the sha256 digests in pack/models.lock.toml.
#
# Committing them would put ~42 MiB of binaries with their own licences into
# every clone of the base repository — the exact thing on-demand Capability
# Packs exist to avoid.
*
!.gitignore
